Proup
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 6 DEAL DUX
DUX 4 FACE_LAST
DUX 9 FACE_LAST
DUX 7 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE DUX DUX
SRC Suit {HEARTS}
MOVE_STACK DUX DUX
DEST Empty
DRAW
PILE ANY DUX Size > 0
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DUX Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL DUX Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
